==Trivia==
*Gunman's Dawn's Japanese name, Gunman no Tasogare (ガンマンの黄昏, "Gunman's Twilight"), may be a reference to ''Yūhi no Gunman'' (夕日のガンマン, "Setting Sun's Gunman"), the Japanese name of the Spaghetti Western film [[wikipedia:For a Few Dollars More|''For a Few Dollars More'']].
*Gunman's Dawn is the most remade stage in the game, with [[Altar of Zeus]], [[Clammy Cove|Clammy Cove]], [[Rogue's Twilight]] and [[Eager Entryway]] all deriving from it.

